[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0638","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0638.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0844","title":"Deerfield MDaemon 2.8.5/2.8.6 URL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Deerfield MDaemon 2.8.5/2.8.6 版本的 WorldClient 和 WebConfig 服务在处理过长 URL 请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送超长的 URL 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃并造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 MDaemon 2.8.5/2.8.6 及 Alt-N WorldClient Pro 2.0.0.0/2.0.1.0/Standard 2.0.0.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送超长 URL 触发漏洞，导致邮件服务中断，CVSS 评分 5.0 属中等严重度。厂商已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0844"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:10Z","remediation":"升级 Deerfield MDaemon 至 2.8.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 WorldClient 与 WebConfig 服务因超长 URL 导致的拒绝服务问题；如暂无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端（如反向代理）配置 URL 长度限制（建议不超过 2048 字节）并限制异常高频请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/820","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/823","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19640","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49836c1c79a31c6cbe258de560530ef5be1db5f4/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0844.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0844","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0844.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/36499b7630ab4a32d11ab7c901b4c87271211bec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0844.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ae10aeb9b17952d60531f6bc06df8547d2b0b568/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4v7m-9h3p-c5mq/GHSA-4v7m-9h3p-c5mq.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mdaemon_webconfig.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0844.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mdaemon_worldclient.nasl","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ec726d2f-1418-46f0-a653-7cb4ac1736ec.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0638.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0638.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0638.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1004","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1189","title":"Netscape Navigator/Communicator 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape Navigator/Communicator 4.7 在处理 URL 时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，当 URL 中 ? 后的参数长度超过缓冲区边界时，会触发栈溢出。远程攻击者可构造包含超长参数的恶意 URL（指向 .asp、.cgi、.html 或 .pl 文件），诱使用户访问后导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98 平台上的 Netscape 4.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1189"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Navigator/Communicator 至 4.73 及以上版本，该版本修复了长 URL 参数导致的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器端过滤超长 URL 请求参数，限制 ? 后参数长度不超过 1024 字节。鉴于该浏览器已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至现代浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/36306","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/36608","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/822","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7884"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1162","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1527","title":"Sun NetBeans Java IDE HTTP服务器IP限制绕过漏洞","description":"Sun NetBeans Developer 3.0 Beta及Forte Community Edition 1.0 Beta内置的HTTP服务器未能正确按照配置文件中的IP白名单规则限制访问，当为特定IP启用服务后，任意远程攻击者无需认证即可通过HTTP 8082端口直接访问服务器根目录及所有子目录，获取IDE内部敏感信息。该漏洞在NetBeans 3.0 Beta中为默认启用状态，用户无需任何操作即可被利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1527"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-11-23T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至NetBeans/Forte正式版（非Beta），该漏洞在稳定版中已修复。临时缓解措施：在项目设置的HTTP Server中将\"Enable\"设为False禁用内置服务器，或在全局设置中移除HTTP Server模块；同时在防火墙层面禁用端口8082的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94338883114254&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/816","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1527.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1527"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1162.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0911","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0911.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1058","title":"Vermillion FTP Daemon 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Vermillion FTP Daemon VFTPD 1.23 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务连续发送多个超长的 CWD（切换工作目录）命令，触发服务端缓冲区溢出，进而导致拒绝服务，并可能执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 VFTPD 1.23 的所有服务器，攻击者无需任何凭据，仅需连接至 21 端口即可发起利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1058"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:37Z","remediation":"立即停用并卸载存在漏洞的 Vermillion FTP Daemon (VFTPD) 1.23，替换为仍在维护的开源 FTP 服务（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD）至最新版本；若必须短期保留，可在边界防火墙限制仅允许受信 IP 访问 TCP 21 端口，并部署入侵检测规则阻断包含超长 CWD 命令的 FTP 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94329968617085&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94337185023159&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/818","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3543","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1058","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1058.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3d905f6009ce1a0cb55b6b90198454d955586615/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1058.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7cj6-wm7r-4g46/GHSA-7cj6-wm7r-4g46.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/V/vftpd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1058.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000890.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d60c1d6c-3fba-4fac-9858-a021833ded43.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0911.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0580","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0580.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0818","title":"Sun Solaris 7.0 kcms_configure 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0 系统中的 kcms_configure 命令存在严重缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过设置过长的 NETPATH 环境变量触发栈缓冲区溢出，劫持程序执行流程。该漏洞存在于默认安装的 Solaris 7.0 系统中，攻击者无需身份验证即可在本地触发漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限实现本地提权。漏洞成因是 kcms_configure 对 NETPATH 环境变量长度缺乏边界检查，导致栈缓冲区溢出覆盖返回地址。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0818"],"sources":["cve","exploit-db","securityfocus"],"published":"1999-11-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Oracle Solaris 10 或 11.4 及以上版本，官方已在后续版本中修复该漏洞。若无法升级，可通过移除 kcms_configure 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/dt/bin/kcms_configure）缓解本地提权风险，或限制用户环境变量 NETPATH 的最大长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.securityfocus.com/bid/831","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19647","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0818","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/main/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0818.json"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19647"],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19647"],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0580.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0580.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0580.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0832","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0832.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0999","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9148,\"outputTokens\":21,\"totalTokens\":10833}}","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 的 Tabular Data Stream (TDS) 数据包解析存在验证不足的问题。攻击者远程发送特制的畸形 TDS 报文，可触发服务端异常，导致 SQL Server 服务崩溃并进入拒绝服务状态。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 7.0 SP1 版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可轻易利用实现服务中断，严重影响数据库服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0999"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"升级到 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2（SP2）或更高版本以修复 TDS 协议解析缺陷。如暂无法升级，可在边界防火墙或 IPS 上过滤并丢弃发往 1433 端口的畸形 TDS 数据包，限制仅允许可信 IP 访问数据库端口，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ248749","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/817","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-059","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19638","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0999.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf63c766a0e51c24a528a42a3e26e4fdf58db9e8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0999.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0999","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/165075bb4c3675993ac058501ff8575bd07a9ca0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0999.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0999.md","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cj38-2rjc-pv2v/GHSA-cj38-2rjc-pv2v.json","https://github.com/morpheuslord/CVE-llm_dataset/blob/91b337d05c623a68829de977c2b1ae6c0f91702b/README.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0999.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0832.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0617","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0831","title":"Linux syslogd 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux syslogd 在处理大量并发连接请求时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量连接请求，耗尽 syslogd 的处理资源，导致系统日志服务崩溃或无法正常记录日志。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，利用难度较低。受影响的系统管理员应限制 syslogd 的连接数或升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0831"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-11-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:08Z","remediation":"升级 sysklogd 至 1.3.3 或更高版本以修复连接数限制问题；若使用遗留系统，在 iptables 中限制 syslog 端口（514/UDP）的传入连接速率，如 `iptables -A INPUT -p udp --dport 514 -m limit --limit 10/s -j ACCEPT`。长期方案建议迁移至 rsyslog 或 syslog-ng 等现代日志系统，或使用 systemd-journald 替代传统 syslogd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/809","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0831.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0831","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0831.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0831.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3cgm-rhf4-87qm/GHSA-3cgm-rhf4-87qm.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0831.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3734eac1-0b8f-4454-909e-1af399633844.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ee86c26ee0202761283d7d612909ed4cc8981bf7/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1124","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1475","title":"ProFTPD mod_sqlpw 密码明文记录漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.2 在启用 mod_sqlpw 模块时，会将用户认证密码明文记录到系统 wtmp 日志文件中，造成敏感信息泄露。本地攻击者可通过 last 等命令读取 wtmp 日志获取其他用户的明文密码，进而提升权限。该漏洞影响 ProFTPD 1.2 版本，利用门槛低，仅需本地访问权限即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1475"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 ProFTPD 至 1.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mod_sqlpw 模块将用户密码记录到 wtmp 日志文件的问题。如无法升级，可限制 wtmp 日志文件的读取权限（仅允许 root 用户访问），并定期清理 wtmp 日志内容，避免在多用户环境下使用 last 命令查看日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/35483","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1475.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1475","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1475.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1475.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6adb77879df86f875473cd5dc5a48fc3b9483823/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x3q5-jc99-rf4p/GHSA-x3q5-jc99-rf4p.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1475.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/812/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a2d2b7f1-e64f-4a15-ac51-d78384529fda.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1600","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0987","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9104,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10785}}","description":"Windows NT 系统在域用户登录时未能正确处理域名的边界情况。当域用户使用在域名末尾带有空格的域名登录到域时，系统无法正确下载并应用系统策略（System Policy），导致安全策略被绕过。该漏洞影响使用域环境且依赖系统策略进行安全管控的 Windows NT 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需诱导或控制域用户以带尾随空格的域名登录域控制器。利用方式上，攻击者可通过构造特殊的登录域名使目标主机跳过应有的安全策略限制，从而削弱系统安全防护、提升本地权限或绕过既定的访问控制策略，造成安全配置失效的风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0987"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:28Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Windows 2000 或更高版本，并安装 Microsoft 发布的安全补丁（如 MS99-024 补丁包 Q246045）。若无法升级，请确保域用户登录时不在域名末尾添加空格，并在域控制器配置严格的域名验证策略防止尾随空格登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ237923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad08212eac84f46206c2da8a50436d48e5ad608c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0987.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0987","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0987.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/72b66ad516faec962399c4214c080517aebc4c11/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0987.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9vg4-j6g2-gw83/GHSA-9vg4-j6g2-gw83.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0987.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000886.txt","https://github.com/chandanbn/notes/blob/90eb64532f7259c55e5531dfc2726d810d17ef6e/cve5-validation-errors-Jan27.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1155","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1519","title":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0 存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 FTP 服务器提交超长的用户名或密码字符串，即可触发缓冲区溢出，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃或资源耗尽，从而使服务不可用。该漏洞利用方式简单，直接发送畸形请求即可实施攻击，影响服务器正常业务运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1519"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"升级 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 至 3.0 及以上版本，该版本对用户名和密码长度做了输入校验。如无法升级，建议在网络防火墙或 IPS 设备上配置规则，限制 FTP 登录用户名和密码字段长度不超过 64 字符，并对发往 21 端口的异常长度数据包进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94286244700573&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/805","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3513","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19624","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4441343672f486c63736487674c197dfd2a4f256/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1519.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1519","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1519.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/33dc7d7c01654661dd82814415270cb51d2d0728/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1519.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jjcx-6qx2-97j8/GHSA-jjcx-6qx2-97j8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1519.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000884.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4272dfa0-df1f-48a4-a99c-9815c63f8c0d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0528","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0528.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0793","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9166,\"outputTokens\":14,\"totalTokens\":10844}}","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 和 4.0.1 版本中存在 JavaScript URL 重定向漏洞 (MS99-043)，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页将数据重定向至 JavaScript 小程序，从而读取用户本地文件系统中的任意文件。该漏洞源于 IE 对 JavaScript URL 重定向处理不当，攻击者只需诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意页面，即可在无需用户交互的情况下窃取本地敏感文件。该漏洞影响 IE 5.0 和 4.0.1 版本，CVSS 评分 2.6（低危），攻击复杂度较高，需用户访问恶意页面触发。Microsoft 已在 MS99-043 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0793"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"升级到 Internet Explorer 6 SP1 或更高版本并应用 Microsoft 安全更新 MS02-018，建议同时更换为 Chrome/Firefox 等现代浏览器。如无法立即升级，可通过注册表禁用 JavaScript 协议处理，并在 Windows 防火墙阻止文件访问流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-043","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19559","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0793.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0283d468fcc07a0a091bff7d6aca02552e8d0048/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0793.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0793","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f7f250b0cc5cc23741447612a2f182f04c36db78/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0793.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0793.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mj4p-5fc7-96gj/GHSA-mj4p-5fc7-96gj.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0793.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0528.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0528.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0935","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0935.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1092","title":"tin 1.4.0 .tin目录权限不安全导致密码泄露漏洞","description":"tin 1.4.0 在用户主目录下创建 .tin 配置目录时使用默认权限 drwxr-xr-x（755），同时 .inputhistory 文件权限为 -rw-rw-r--（664）。当用户使用需要认证的新闻服务器时，tin 会记录所有键盘输入并保存至 ~/.tin/.inputhistory，其他本地用户可直接读取该文件获取明文密码等敏感信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1092"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 tin 至更高版本修复目录权限问题；或手动执行 rm -f ~/.tin/.inputhistory && touch ~/.tin/.inputhistory && chmod 000 ~/.tin/.inputhistory 禁止其他用户读取该文件。同时建议使用安全认证方式避免密码明文存储。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94286179032648&w=2","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-1092"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0935.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0935.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0935.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1980","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1980.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1508","title":"Tektronix PhaserLink Printer 管理员密码泄露漏洞","description":"Tektronix PhaserLink 打印机 Web 服务器存在未授权访问漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，直接调用 ncl_items.html 和 ncl_subjects.html 等未公开 URL 即可绕过权限验证，获取管理员密码。该漏洞影响 Phaser 740/750/750DP/840/930 等型号打印机，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。厂商未提供官方补丁，建议禁用 PhaserLink Web 服务或限制网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1508"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:35Z","remediation":"由于该漏洞影响的老旧机型（Tektronix Phaser 740/750/840/930等）厂商已停止支持且无安全补丁，建议立即禁用 PhaserLink Web 服务（通过打印机面板或 telnet 进入设置关闭 HTTP 服务）；如无法关闭，则在网络边界防火墙对打印机管理端口（默认 80/TCP）设置 IP 白名单，限制仅授权管理 IP 可访问，并将打印机隔离至独立 VLAN，避免暴露在非信任网络中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94286041430870&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/806","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19632","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5dccbdd02e04ed15263189c9e9adec0bd125446a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1508.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1508","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1508.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6471e48aab3adc28479bf4c8fa1d38ad4787a75a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1508.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db7261396795ee10e4834f0fdf94aec36b0936ff/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-57xx-x4mm-8j32/GHSA-57xx-x4mm-8j32.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/5e88ee9ad3a609edcd3b4d8a3e889c68f1751989/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/ncl_items.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/806/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1508.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1980.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1980.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1980.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1177","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1549","title":"Lynx 代码执行漏洞","description":"Lynx 2.x 版本存在源验证漏洞（CWE-346），该程序未能正确区分内部与外部 HTML 内容，导致本地攻击者可通过读取临时文件中存储的\"安全\"隐藏表单值，并构造特制的 LYNXOPTIONS: URL 来修改用户配置文件，进而执行任意命令。漏洞影响 Lynx 2.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需要本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1549"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:41Z","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至 2.9.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 LYNXOPTIONS: URL 处理中对内部与外部 HTML 来源的区分问题。同时建议配置 --enable-config-file 编译选项限制仅允许受信任的配置文件路径，并避免在协同环境下使用 lynx 浏览不可信本地文件。如无法升级，可移除 lynx 的 setuid 权限并限制用户对该二进制文件的访问。tmp","statu